1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,808
A lush, misty valley under a cloudy sky. A colossal white spacecraft hovers in the distance. In the foreground, several tall, robotic beings stand among the grass and trees. Their bodies are built from sharp, detached geometric shapes, with dark, ribbon-like tentacles trailing behind them.

2
00:00:11,943 --> 00:00:12,849
One robot holds a glowing pink flower.

3
00:00:20,635 --> 00:00:24,000
In the robot's palm, the delicate pink flower suddenly morphs into a glowing, angular white crystal.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The robot gazes at the floating, geometric gem. Its body is composed of dark, disconnected shards, anchored around the brightly glowing red core in its chest.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Everything fades into darkness.
